@api = http://localhost:3000
@email = debug@example.test
@password = Debug-password-123!

### Health
GET {{api}}/api/health

### OpenAPI
GET {{api}}/openapi.json

### Register a disposable local user
POST {{api}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Login (the REST Client keeps the session cookie)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Current user
GET {{api}}/api/auth/me

### Conversations
GET {{api}}/api/conversations

### Systems
GET {{api}}/api/systems

### Terminal activity
GET {{api}}/api/terminal/activity

### Operation proposals
GET {{api}}/api/operations/proposals

### Training runs
GET {{api}}/api/models/training-runs

### Checkpoints
GET {{api}}/api/models/checkpoints

### Evaluations
GET {{api}}/api/models/evaluations

### Logout
POST {{api}}/api/auth/logout
